Debug and correct a supplied buggy HTML file.

BUGGY CODE 
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>My Resume</title>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>Manisha Tiwari<h1>
    <p>BCA Student - Artificial Intelligence<p>

    <h2>Education<h2>
    <p>BCA with AI - Invertis University, Bareilly

    <h2>Skills</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Java
        <li>HTML and CSS</li>
        <li>MS Excel</li>
    </ul>

    <p>Thank you for reading my resume.

</body>
</html>

NOW CORRECT CODE

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Resume</title>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Manisha Tiwari</h1>
        <p>BCA Student - Artificial Intelligence</p>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section>
            <h2>Education</h2>
            <p>BCA with AI - Invertis University, Bareilly</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Skills</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Java</li>
                <li>HTML and CSS</li>
                <li>MS Excel</li>
            </ul>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>Thank you for reading my resume.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
  


  CORRECTIONS;
   Corrected closing heading tags, such as <h1> to </h1>.
 Added missing closing </p> tags.
 Closed all <li> list items.
 Added lang="en" and character encoding.
 Used semantic tags: <header>, <main>, <section>, and <footer>.